/home/brunner56/kp-live-20260922/motion-m0-rederivation.md-203-Other risks, not verified:
/home/brunner56/kp-live-20260922/motion-m0-rederivation.md:204:- AddToArea re-reads 2DA state and resets `+0x33C`/`+0x340`, and Remove/Add runs area object remove and add, which may re-fire area events or client create and destroy. Using Remove/Add per tick for smooth motion (M4) is unverified as safe. A per-tick SetPosition plus one final Remove/Add "settle" is the cheaper-to-reverse design. Treat it as a proposal only.
